*> Acceptance test, the raiders' celebration (docs/protocol/20 section 13 Celebration; lane 002-lane-mobsb5, T8913): when a raid is lost the raiders without a target celebrate
*> (metadata 16 true, sent as Set Entity Data 0x65) and when the raid ends the flag is cleared.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US15-RAID-CELEBRATE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY BRWORLD.
 COPY RAIDSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTYPE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E2                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-WANTED              BINARY-LONG VALUE 101.
 01 WS-EXPECTED            PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-ONE                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(8).
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BYTE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CH                  PIC X.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
     MOVE PL-CONN(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-CONN
     MOVE "minecraft:pillager" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-PTYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE PL-X(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-X
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Y
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Z
     MOVE 2 TO BW-DIFFICULTY
     MOVE 1 TO RD-USED(1)
     MOVE 5 TO RD-ID(1)
     MOVE 1 TO RD-STATUS(1)
     MOVE WS-DIM TO RD-DIM(1)
     COMPUTE RD-CX(1) = WS-X + 5000
     MOVE 1 TO RD-GROUPS(1)
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-PTYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-E
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-PTYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-E2
     MOVE WS-PLAYER TO EN-TARGET(WS-E2)
     CALL "RAID-JOIN" USING WS-SLOT WS-ONE WS-E WS-ZERO
     CALL "RAID-JOIN" USING WS-SLOT WS-ONE WS-E2 WS-ZERO
     MOVE "none" TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 drain before the loss" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "RC-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RAID-TICK" USING WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 the raid is lost" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RD-STATUS(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 a raider without a target celebrates" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-VARIANT(WS-E) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 a raider with a target does not" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-VARIANT(WS-E2) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 1
         MOVE EN-ID(WS-E) TO WS-BYTE
         MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(WS-BYTE + 1) TO WS-CH
         MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(FUNCTION HEX-OF(WS-CH)) TO WS-HEX(1:2)
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     STRING WS-HEX(1:2) "100801ff" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 metadata 16 true is sent" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "RC-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RAID-DROP" USING WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 the end of the raid clears the flag (2 = sent false)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-VARIANT(WS-E) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     STRING WS-HEX(1:2) "100800ff" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§13 metadata 16 false is sent" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "RC-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US15-RAID-CELEBRATE.

 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. RC-CHECK-HEX.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==PK-==.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 65536.
 01 WS-CLOSE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-THRESHOLD           BINARY-LONG VALUE -1.
 01 WS-PACKET-ID           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OUTCOME             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AREA                PIC X(65536) BASED.
 01 WS-COPY                PIC X(512).
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(4096).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-CASE                 PIC X(240).
 01 L-WANTED               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-EXPECTED             PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ID L-CASE L-WANTED L-EXPECTED.
     MOVE "none" TO WS-HEX
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FOUND WS-OUTCOME
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PK-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN" USING L-ID PB-BUFFER WS-CLOSE
     PERFORM UNTIL WS-OUTCOME NOT = 0
         CALL "TEST-NEXT-PACKET" USING PB-BUFFER PK-BUFFER WS-THRESHOLD WS-PACKET-ID WS-OUTCOME
         IF WS-OUTCOME = 0 AND WS-PACKET-ID = L-WANTED AND WS-FOUND = 0
             MOVE 1 TO WS-FOUND
             SET ADDRESS OF WS-AREA TO PK-ADDR
             COMPUTE WS-COUNT = PK-LENGTH - PK-POS
             MOVE SPACES TO WS-COPY
             MOVE WS-AREA(PK-POS + 1:WS-COUNT) TO WS-COPY
             CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING WS-COPY WS-COUNT WS-HEX
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PK-BUFFER
     MOVE WS-HEX TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM RC-CHECK-HEX.
